<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:10:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>小鹏汽车总裁谈汽车制造商的机器人推动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/xpeng-president-on-carmaker-s-robot-push-video</link><description>小鹏汽车副董事长兼总裁顾布莱恩 (Brian Gu) 讨论了仿人机器人技术作为汽车制造商的下一个增长动力。他在“彭博社：中国秀”上发表独家演讲。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/xpeng-president-on-carmaker-s-robot-push-video'&gt;小鹏汽车总裁谈汽车制造商的机器人推动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Xpeng President on Carmaker's Robot Push&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/xpeng-president-on-carmaker-s-robot-push-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:45:55 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢比期权自二月份以来首次发出看涨信号</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-options-signal-bullish-shift-for-first-time-since-february</link><description>自2月份以来，期权市场对冲卢比疲软相对成本的相对成本指标首次转为负值，表明人们对印度货币的乐观情绪日益增强。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-options-signal-bullish-shift-for-first-time-since-february'&gt;卢比期权自二月份以来首次发出看涨信号&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Rupee Options Signal Bullish Shift for First Time Since February&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/rupee-options-signal-bullish-shift-for-first-time-since-february</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:48:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>韩国央行将关键利率上调至 3.25%</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bok-hikes-key-rate-to-3-25-video</link><description>韩国央行恢复加息，将基准利率上调25个基点至3.25%。此次加息是在 7 月和 8 月连续加息之后，在 10 月暂停后进行的。彭博社的丹尼·托马斯 (Denny Thomas) 从韩国央行的决定中获得了主要收获。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bok-hikes-key-rate-to-3-25-video'&gt;韩国央行将关键利率上调至 3.25%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：BOK Hikes Key Rate to 3.25%&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/bok-hikes-key-rate-to-3-25-video</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 05:52:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks, Nasdaq Futures Climb as AI Trade Rebounds: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</link><description>巴基斯坦证券交易所计划明年推出股票期权，为投资者提供另一种工具，让他们押注过去三年增长了两倍的市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options'&gt;中国支持的巴基斯坦交易所准备推出股票期权&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China-Backed Pakistan Exchange Prepares to Launch Stock Options&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/china-backed-pakistan-exchange-prepares-to-launch-stock-options</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 04:00:15 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>